  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In-kind donation of humanitarian aid to Ukraine 2022_1 (Ministry of Health UA)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Materi&#xE1;lna humanit&#xE1;rna pomoc Ukrajina 2022_1 - Ministerstvo zdravotn&#xED;ctva UA (&#x160;t&#xE1;tny in&#x161;tit&#xFA;t verejn&#xE9;ho zdravia)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Ministerstvo vn&#xFA;tra Slovenskej republiky a &#x160;pr&#xE1;va &#x161;t&#xE1;tnych hmotn&#xFD;ch rezerv&#xA0;&#xA0;poskytli v prvom polroku 2022 humanit&#xE1;rnu pomoc Ukrajine - lie&#x10D;iv&#xE1;, zdravotn&#xED;cky materi&#xE1;l, dezinfek&#x10D;n&#xE9; g&#xE9;ly na ruky a nosidl&#xE1;.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Ministry of Interior of the Slovak Republic and&#xA0;Ministry of Health of the Slovak Republic have provided in-kind donation of humanitarian aid to Ukraine in first half of 2022 - farmaceuticals, medical equipment, hand sanitizers, stretchers.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
